# Codebase Knowledge Graph (codebase-memory-mcp)

Use MCP graph tools for code discovery. Priority:
1. `search_graph` — find functions, classes, routes, variables
2. `trace_path` — trace callers/callees
3. `get_code_snippet` — read function/class source
4. `query_graph` — Cypher for complex patterns
5. `get_architecture` — high-level summary

Fall back to grep/glob only for: string literals, error messages, config values, non-code files.
<!-- codebase-memory-mcp:end -->

